  "instructions": [
    "Combine the rice, water, and 1/2 tsp salt in a medium pot. Bring to a boil, cover, and reduce to low. Cook 15 minutes until the water is absorbed, then rest covered 5 minutes.",
    "Whisk the olive oil, lemon juice, garlic, oregano, 1 tsp salt, and pepper in a bowl. This is the dressing.",
    "Put the chicken in a bowl with half of the dressing. Toss to coat and let it sit while the grill heats.",
    "Heat a grill or grill pan to medium-high. Thread the chicken onto metal skewers, or grill the pieces in a grill basket.",
    "Grill the chicken 10 to 12 minutes, turning every 3 minutes, until browned and an instant-read thermometer reads 165 F.",
    "Toss the cucumber, tomatoes, and red onion with 2 tbsp of the remaining dressing.",
    "Fluff the rice and divide it among 4 bowls. Top with the chicken and the salad.",
    "Drizzle the remaining dressing over each bowl and serve."
  ],
